  "description": "Meet the TUES CORE 2, a full-progression shred-sled set to slash your times as you grab dopamine by the handful. This latest evolution is steeped in racing heritage and equipped with the tuning options needed to accelerate your gravity skills. From the race line to the bike park, TUES MK4 does it all with unstoppable confidence, staying one step ahead of your every move as you scorch your way to the hot seat.You can count on the CORE 2 to perform. Equipped with tunable RockShox suspension and powerful SRAM DB8 brakes, it bleeds control, while DH-spec Maxxis tires and a Race Face cockpit ensure nothing misses the mark. In essence, TUES CORE 2 is the platform you need to kickstart your race career as you leave your competition for dust.MX or 29\" – with FLIP LINK, you choose both. The new TUES is both MX and 29\" capable without the need for additional frame parts.",
